{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32447","headline":"题李卫公诗二首 二 · 温庭筠","name":"题李卫公诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"势欲凌云威触天，权倾诸夏力排山。\n三年骥尾有人附，一日龙须无路攀。\n画合不开梁燕去，朱门罢埽乳鸦还。\n千岩万壑应惆怅，流水斜倾出武关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}